From 29c082ed4901905d94dd43a316cd501e41998fa8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuan Yuan <soc.yuan@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2026 05:02:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] [feat]: NPU graph capture with ACL callback worker and
 CPU MoE in graph

Land ascend_callback_worker for aclrtLaunchCallback dispatch; async
submit_with_cuda_stream on prefill, _launch_host_func on graph decode.
Re-enable cuda-graph in p27 launch scripts. Submodule sglang: kt_ep_wrapper.
F2 four-prompt regression passed (N=0 + N=32 hybrid, graph on).

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

diff --git a/doc/zh/DeepSeek-V4-Flash_Ascend_NPU_Single_Card_Handoff.md b/doc/zh/DeepSeek-V4-Flash_Ascend_NPU_Single_Card_Handoff.md
